## 📱 Blynk Mobile App Setup

Setting up the mobile dashboard takes less than a minute.

### 1️⃣ Open Blynk App
Select your device and tap **Edit Dashboard**.

### 2️⃣ Add a Switch Widget
Configure the switch as:

| Setting | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Datastream | V0 |
| Mode | Switch |

### 3️⃣ Save & Run
Exit edit mode and start controlling your appliance instantly.

### 🎛 Dashboard Preview

```text
┌──────────────────────┐
│ 🏠 Home Automation   │
├──────────────────────┤
│ 💡 Relay Control     │
│      ON / OFF        │
└──────────────────────┘
```

### ⚡ Operation

```text
Switch ON  → Relay ON  → Bulb ON 💡

Switch OFF → Relay OFF → Bulb OFF 🌙
```

Control your home appliances securely from anywhere using the Blynk IoT mobile application.